Action reality.
Serial tanpa naskah dan acara olahraga non-tempur dari genre realitas. Program yang ditayangkan di blok ini antara lain Lingerie Football League, Top Gear Korea, Top Gear Amerika Serikat, Top Gear Australia, Car Matchmaker, Car Crash, Heroes and Superstars, Infinite Challenge, Jonathan Goodwin (ahli pelarian), The Incredible Mr, Steve Austin's Broken Skull Challenge", Tornado Hunters, Drive, The Next Great Burger, The Ultimate Brocation, The Dude Perfect Show, Fifth Gear, Extreme Ends, Australian Ninja Warrior, G Wars, The Great Escape (serial TV U.Serikat), What Went Down, Hunted, XRC, Britania Tersulit, Rute Alternatif, Perbaikan Akhir Pekan, Ilusi Keagungan, Pelarian, Pemicu Senang, Roda Gila, dan Manusia Perjalanan.
